  "answer": "Project Zenith is an initiative aimed at optimizing cloud storage solutions, enhancing security, and leveraging AI for predictive analytics and data visualization. The project was initiated in Q3 2023 with Marcus Cole as the project leader, following a kickoff meeting on July 15th. Key milestones include an initial findings report in August highlighting a potential 20% efficiency increase, a budget approval of $2M in August, and a subsequent budget adjustment to $550,000 due to unforeseen expenses. Recent progress includes a breakthrough in predictive analytics, with a detailed report scheduled for November 20th. Feedback on the prototype is being sought by the end of November, and security protocols involving multi-factor authentication and encryption are set to update in January."
